  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learners in East Shewa and West Arsi Zone of Oromia and Northern Zone and Hawassa of Sidama in Ethiopia will improve access and participation in inclusive primary education, wellbeing and learning outcomes. It will provide education pathways for marginalized, out-of-school children, girls, children with disabilities and IDPs in remote areas. It will strengthen competence and wellbeing of teachers to provide effective teaching. It will build capacity of CSOs to engage in dialogue and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
